ion id=\"id-a1da9e16\" name=\"6-wood\" data-type=\"user\" data-header=\"header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block  \" style=\" \" data-blocktype=\"rich-text\" data-blockid=\"id-626c58d8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content text-block align-center inner-wide\" id=\"text-block-id-626c58d8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t      <div data-block-id=\"id-626c58d8\" data-config=\"{&quot;blockName&quot;:&quot;richText&quot;,&quot;blockId&quot;:&quot;id-626c58d8&quot;,&quot;blockType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;legacySpacingStyle&quot;:&quot;padding-top:10px; padding-bottom:0px; &quot;,&quot;content&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Wood and Bamboo Boards Trap Harmful Bacteria&lt;/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;outerClassName&quot;:&quot;align-center inner-wide&quot;}\" data-hydration-root=\"true\"><div class=\"rich-text\" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:0px\"><h2>Wood and Bamboo Boards Trap Harmful Bacteria</h2></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t<div class=\"block  \" style=\" \" data-blocktype=\"rich-text\" data-blockid=\"id-dbf3b475\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content text-block align-center inner-wide\" id=\"text-block-id-dbf3b475\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t      <div data-block-id=\"id-dbf3b475\" data-config=\"{&quot;blockName&quot;:&quot;richText&quot;,&quot;blockId&quot;:&quot;id-dbf3b475&quot;,&quot;blockType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;legacySpacingStyle&quot;:&quot;padding-top:0px; padding-bottom:10px; &quot;,&quot;content&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Wood and bamboo are porous. Knife grooves absorb moisture, raw meat juices, and bacteria below the surface.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This bacteria can transfer into food and may contribute to &lt;strong&gt;foodborne illness, digestive irritation, and repeated exposure&lt;/strong&gt; — especially concerning for children and older adults.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;outerClassName&quot;:&quot;align-center inner-wide&quot;}\" data-hydration-root=\"true\"><div class=\"rich-text\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-bottom:10px\"><p>Wood and bamboo are porous. Knife grooves absorb moisture, raw meat juices, and bacteria below the surface.</p><p>This bacteria can transfer into food and may contribute to <strong>foodborne illness, digestive irritation, and repeated exposure</strong> — especially concerning for children and older adults.</p></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t<div class=\"block  \" style=\" \" data-blocktype=\"html\" data-blockid=\"id-8c204ab5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content html-block\" id=\"html-block-block-id-8c204ab5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t      <div data-block-id=\"id-8c204ab5\" data-config=\"{&quot;blockName&quot;:&quot;html&quot;,&quot;blockId&quot;:&quot;id-8c204ab5&quot;,&quot;blockType&quot;:&quot;html&quot;,&quot;content&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\" data-hydration-root=\"true\"><div><div class=\"product-intro\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  <div class=\"product-intro-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    <video autoplay=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" loop=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t      <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/19e520ed6f4d4fea9e1cd4de8009926c.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    </video>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t<div class=\"block  \" style=\" \" data-blocktype=\"generic-button\" data-blockid=\"id-6873b278\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content generic-button-block inner-narrow\" id=\"generic-button-block-id-6873b278\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t      <div data-block-id=\"id-6873b278\" data-config=\"{&quot;blockName&quot;:&quot;genericButton&quot;,&quot;blockId&quot;:&quot;id-6873b278&quot;,&quot;blockType&quot;:&quot;generic-button&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;generic-button&quot;,&quot;destination&quot;:&quot;id-7c06e7d1&quot;,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;continue large&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Next&quot;,&quot;paddingTop&quot;:20,&quot;paddingBottom&quot;:20,&quot;nextAct