d-8a2f2cab&quot;,&quot;blockType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;legacySpacingStyle&quot;:&quot;padding-top:10px; &quot;,&quot;content&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Glass Boards Chip and Transfer Glass Into Food&lt;/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;outerClassName&quot;:&quot;align-center inner-wide&quot;}\" data-hydration-root=\"true\"><div class=\"rich-text\" style=\"padding-top:10px\"><h2>Glass Boards Chip and Transfer Glass Into Food</h2></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t<div class=\"block  \" style=\" \" data-blocktype=\"rich-text\" data-blockid=\"id-e8860163\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content text-block inner-wide align-center\" id=\"text-block-id-e8860163\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t      <div data-block-id=\"id-e8860163\" data-config=\"{&quot;blockName&quot;:&quot;richText&quot;,&quot;blockId&quot;:&quot;id-e8860163&quot;,&quot;blockType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;legacySpacingStyle&quot;:&quot;padding-top:0px; padding-bottom:10px; &quot;,&quot;content&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Cutting on glass causes microscopic glass chipping with repeated use.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;These fragments can enter food and irritate the digestive tract or cause &lt;strong&gt;internal micro-injuries over time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Glass also severely dulls knives.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;outerClassName&quot;:&quot;inner-wide align-center&quot;}\" data-hydration-root=\"true\"><div class=\"rich-text\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-bottom:10px\"><p>Cutting on glass causes microscopic glass chipping with repeated use.</p><p>These fragments can enter food and irritate the digestive tract or cause <strong>internal micro-injuries over time.</strong></p><p>Glass also severely dulls knives.</p></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t<div class=\"block  \" style=\" \" data-blocktype=\"image\" data-blockid=\"img-eca96602\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content image-block inner-mid\" style=\"\" id=\"image-block-img