e=\"padding-top:10px\"><h2>Steel Isn’t Antibacterial — and It’s Harsh on Knives</h2></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t<div class=\"block  \" style=\" \" data-blocktype=\"rich-text\" data-blockid=\"id-b481971f\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content text-block inner-wide align-center\" id=\"text-block-id-b481971f\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  \n\t\t\t\t\t\t      <div data-block-id=\"id-b481971f\" data-config=\"{&quot;blockName&quot;:&quot;richText&quot;,&quot;blockId&quot;:&quot;id-b481971f&quot;,&quot;blockType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;legacySpacingStyle&quot;:&quot;padding-top:0px; padding-bottom:10px; &quot;,&quot;content&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Steel boards are not naturally antibacterial. &lt;strong&gt;Scratches allow bacteria to survive and spread between foods.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Steel is also similar in strength to knife blades, meaning they grind against each other — accelerating dulling and blade damage.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;outerClassName&quot;:&quot;inner-wide align-center&quot;}\" data-hydration-root=\"true\"><div class=\"rich-text\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-bottom:10px\"><p>Steel boards are not naturally antibacterial. <strong>Scratches allow bacteria to survive and spread between foods.</strong></p><p>Steel is also similar in strength to knife blades, meaning they grind against each other — accelerating dulling and blade damage.</p></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t<div class=\"block  \" style=\" \" data-blocktype=\"image\" data-blockid=\"id-3f58b704\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content image-block inner-mid\" style=\"\" id=\"image-block-id-3f58b704\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t      <div data-block-id=\"id-3f58b704\" data-config=\"{&quot;blockName&quot;:&quot;image&quot;,&quot;blockId&quot;:&quot;id-3f58b704&quot;,&quot;blockType&quot;:&quot;image&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;image&quot;,&quot;containerClass&qu